- Congratulations! You have reached room 11!!

## Section: Advanced Pipeline

To pass this room:
---------------------------------------------------------------------

- You found a mysterious artifact encoded in multiple layers!
- The file `artifact.b64` has been wrapped in 3 layers of encoding:

  Layer 3 (outermost): Base64
  Layer 2: Gzip compression
  Layer 1 (innermost): Tar archive

## Tasks:

To unwrap, reverse the layers:

1. Decode the Base64 layer:
   >> `base64 -d artifact.b64 > artifact.tar.gz`

2. Decompress the gzip layer:
   >> `gunzip artifact.tar.gz` (produces artifact.tar)
   >> OR: `gzip -d artifact.tar.gz`

3. Extract the tar archive:
   >> `tar xf artifact.tar`

4. Read the extracted file to find the password!
   >> hint: use `file` command to identify unknown file types
   >> hint: `ls` to see what was extracted

>> Decrypt tip for next room:
   openssl enc -aes-256-cbc -d -a -pbkdf2 -in ../room_12/README -out ../room_12/README.txt -pass pass:PASSWORD

Good Luck !!!
